    "body": "The note preceding the [mixin where `getElementById` is declared](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-nonelementparentnode) explains this:\r\n\r\n> Web compatibility prevents the [getElementById()](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-nonelementparentnode-getelementbyid) method from being exposed on [elements](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element) (and therefore on [ParentNode](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#parentnode)).",
